  "releaseNotes": "v1.11.0: Minor release aligned with Docs v2.0; general documentation and samples refresh. v1.10.1: Documentation improvements and related package links. v1.10.0: Query Optimization - Added CompiledQuery for 95% faster repeated query execution. Pre-compile LINQ expressions to SQL once and reuse. Automatic caching with statistics (GetStatistics, ClearCache). Thread-safe concurrent execution. 19 new unit tests + 5 integration tests. 230 total tests passing. v1.9.0: Async Streaming with ToAsyncEnumerable(). v1.8.0: Existence checks with Any/All predicates. v1.7.0: Distinct() and Contains()/IN clause.",
